# Trinidadian Doubles

Based on [Cooking with Ria](https://cookingwithria.com/2018/12/how-to-make-trinidad-doubles-detailed-recipe-instructions) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250905121621/https://cookingwithria.com/2018/12/how-to-make-trinidad-doubles-detailed-recipe-instructions/)), [Gaz Oakley](https://www.gazoakleychef.com/recipes/trinidadian-doubles) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251202110536/https://www.gazoakleychef.com/recipes/trinidadian-doubles/)), and [TriniGourmet](https://www.trinigourmet.com/trinidad-doubles-recipe) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251011073809/https://www.trinigourmet.com/trinidad-doubles-recipe/))

